WEBVTT

00:00:05.571 --> 00:00:08.484
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> The Highland Hotel’s 20 miles from here.

00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:11.143
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Fine. No problem.

00:00:11.629 --> 00:00:12.724
Let’s go there.

00:00:13.248 --> 00:00:13.986
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> Yes.

00:00:15.079 --> 00:00:16.436
Alfie’s asleep now.

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:17.642
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Great.

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:21.057
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> Mel! Look!

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:22.675
A police car!

00:00:23.161 --> 00:00:24.677
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> OK, OK.

00:00:39.644 --> 00:00:40.350
<v><b>Officer:</b></v> Good evening.

00:00:41.152 --> 00:00:42.905
Turn off the engine, please.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:45.218
Thank you.

00:00:45.926 --> 00:00:47.748
Can I see your driver’s license?

00:00:49.375 --> 00:00:49.970
Thank you.

00:00:50.746 --> 00:00:52.587
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> What’s the problem, officer?

00:00:53.063 --> 00:00:55.388
<v><b>Officer:</b></v> One of your back lights isn’t on.

00:00:55.967 --> 00:00:58.452
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Oh. I’m very sorry, officer.

00:00:58.952 --> 00:01:02.203
We’re on our way to the Highland Hotel.

00:01:02.632 --> 00:01:04.712
We’re very close to it now.

00:01:05.204 --> 00:01:07.113
And we have a baby.

00:01:07.606 --> 00:01:09.913
<v><b>Officer:</b></v> Ah, what a beautiful baby!

00:01:10.597 --> 00:01:11.454
What’s his name?

00:01:11.859 --> 00:01:12.642
<v><b>Lisa:</b></v> Alfie.

00:01:14.287 --> 00:01:16.073
<v><b>Officer:</b></v> Oh, sorry!

00:01:16.771 --> 00:01:19.758
OK… go to your hotel.

00:01:20.567 --> 00:01:22.571
But please drive slowly.

00:01:23.253 --> 00:01:24.780
And fix your light.

00:01:25.495 --> 00:01:27.690
There’s a garage near the hotel.

00:01:28.294 --> 00:01:30.622
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Yes – thank you, officer.

00:01:31.182 --> 00:01:31.960
<v><b>Officer:</b></v> Goodbye.

00:01:32.683 --> 00:01:34.023
Goodbye, Alfie!

00:01:40.719 --> 00:01:42.084
<v><b>Mel:</b></v> Good job, Alfie…